            text: _("I hope my units will survive the counter-attack if I can’t take this grunt out this turn. I’d better grab more villages if I can and move everyone closer for next turn."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Galdrad",
            text: _("If one of your Shamans stands just behind your wounded units, she will heal each of them 4 hitpoints at the beginning of the next turn."),
