      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 14,
            y: 10,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Galdrad",
            text: _("We must occupy that island before the Wolf Riders reach it!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "student",
            text: _("Can’t we just move around the orcs?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: "",
            y: "",
            item_name: "",
            image: "misc%2Fhighlight-hex.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to_unit",
            id: "Dumbo",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Galdrad",
            text: _("No. Once you move close to an enemy unit, you are in its <i>Zone of Control</i> and cannot move further that turn. To move your troops onto that island without wading slowly through the water, you’ll have to kill the Grunt."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("The hexes immediately around a unit constitute its <i>Zone of Control</i>. When an enemy unit enters those hexes, they cannot move any further that turn. (An exception are units with the <i>skirmisher</i> ability, who are unaffected by zones of control.) This can be used to create a blockade to prevent stronger enemies from reaching key locations, such as villages, even if you have limited manpower."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: "",
            y: "",
            item_name: "",
            image: "misc%2Fhighlight-hex.png",
          },
        ],
      },
