            x: 15,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Galdrad",
            text: _("Careful! It is now nighttime. Orcs are <i>chaotic</i>, which means their attacks are now 25% stronger. By day, their attacks are 25% weaker, which is a noticeable difference. You are <i>lawful</i>: stronger by day and weaker at night. Your elvish warriors are <i>neutral</i>: unaffected by the time of day."),
          },
        ],
